Robot Framework is mainly used for acceptance testing.
Acceptance testing is an end-to-end testing process where the client or end user verifies that the application works according to their requirements.
Usually the client is non-technical, so we execute the test cases and show the results through reports and logs generated by Robot Framework.
Acceptance test driven development(ATDD)
approach is keydriven app---buitin keywords,userdefined keywords
python/java
https://robotframework.org/
